<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>No wonder I felt worn out. I'd been with <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> for three whole hours.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It probably wasn't just <STYLE ID="1">Auntie's</STYLE> shrill voice that wore me out. It was that she'd almost seen to the bottom of my heart.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\茅萱の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I threw myself onto the bed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a nice day, so I'd wanted to hang my futon out to air, but unfortunately the sky over my heart was no weather for airing futons.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\携帯茅萱切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I took out my phone and called the second name in my call log.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\携帯茅萱入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "4000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... Hello, Hana-chan?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Yeah, it turns out today doesn't really work for me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'm really sorry to cancel at the last minute, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Yeah... sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\携帯茅萱切.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
In the end, I passed on tonight's drinking party.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The weather in my heart was that bad today.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> died 10 years ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ever since, cherry blossoms and blood have danced through every spring of mine.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Nine years ago, I think it was... Shirozaki-san's wife.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mrs. Shirozaki, trying to turn <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> in to the police, and Shirozaki-san, trying to stop her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭夜2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
One night, when I'd gone out into our yard, I faintly heard the Shirozakis <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="くちげんか">quarreling</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mixed in with their angry shouting were <STYLE ID="4">Dad's</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Mom's</STYLE> names.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I snuck into the yard of the Shirozaki house.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\城崎家.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ゆりこ">Yuriko</STYLE>, calm down. It's true that <STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-kun</STYLE> is in a position that easily draws suspicion. 
{PAUSE ""}
That's exactly why we need to be a little more―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What are you talking about!?
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="7">Grand Witch-sama</STYLE> is trying to settle it right here without even calling the police―don't you find that suspicious!?
{PAUSE ""}
　It means the Niimura family is covering for whoever killed <STYLE ID="3">Sakura-chan</STYLE>, doesn't it!?"<PG>
"But there wasn't any proof that <STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-kun</STYLE> did it!
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-kun</STYLE> himself knows full well that he's under suspicion!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Then tomorrow I'm going to the police. 
{PAUSE ""}
I'll have outsiders take a proper look."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You mean to bring outsiders in!?"<PG>
"Do you want to live in the same settlement as a murderer?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's the conversation, as far as I dimly remember it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mrs. Shirozaki was trying to turn <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> in to the police.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I had seen with my own eyes the moment <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> cut off <STYLE ID="3">Mom's</STYLE> head.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\ホラーサウンド.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "$000080" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎鉈1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I'd seen it on a TV drama once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even with a dead body, cutting it up or dumping it was a crime.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which meant that tomorrow the police would come, and <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> would be arrested...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For me at 11, it was a cruel thing to face.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
For hands like mine, killing a middle-aged woman on the spot was no hard thing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the middle of the night, when everyone was asleep, I slipped silently into the Shirozaki house and drove a knife into her throat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That alone was enough to keep the police from taking <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Nobody so much as suspected that an 11-year-old child had done it.<PG>
Even so, suspicion kept falling on <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Every year, just one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I timed them to Arata's own strange phenomenon of people dying in April.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At some point, it came to be called the curse-killings.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The people I killed: five in all―
{PAUSE ""}
in the springs of Shiyo 791 through 795.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In Shiyo 795 <STYLE ID="4">Dad's</STYLE> confinement in the meeting hall ended, and <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> was finally cleared of suspicion as well.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
But things were taking a turn for the worse.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\能面背景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
By then, with suspicion feeding on itself over who would be killed each April, the settlement had sunk into a place where all the residents suspected one another.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the surface they all say 'all for one, one for all,' but what they think inside―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The curse-killings from Shiyo 796 on are what laid it bare.<PG>
I don't know who caused the curse-killings from Shiyo 796 on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's true that I was the one who started the curse-killings.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I killed five people with these hands.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My heart, which committed murder in those impressionable years from 11 to 15―
{PAUSE ""}
never cleared up, not once in all that long, long time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In time, the storm in my heart swallowed the Arata settlement, and the settlement is still adrift in a storm that shows no sign of ending.<PG>
If I came forward and admitted I was the culprit, would the curse-killings end?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That probably wouldn't work.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The curse-killings after <STYLE ID="4">Dad's</STYLE> confinement ended happened without my hand in them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way the suspicion feeding on itself will just disappear.<PG>
Besides, if anyone learned what led me to start the curse-killings, what would become of <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Grandma</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't leave <STYLE ID="8">Kana</STYLE> all alone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was foolish.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No. I am foolish.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To think a killing that was only meant to get me through the moment would end up like this.<PG>
But it's too late now. I killed five people to protect my family.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I did was shake off the ones in my way, who suspected <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> and tried to tear my family apart.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's just that where I shook them off to happened to be an abyss.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They just fell into the abyss and died.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\茅萱の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\携帯茅萱入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
―My phone vibrated.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a message from <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE>.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Sending you the photos of </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> from Motoki-cho (^-^)"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She'd agreed to send me photos so I'd know what kind of girls were coming.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
This girl was <STYLE ID="12">Erina Goto</STYLE>, the one she'd shown me earlier too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently she'd be starting high school in April, but she really was small for that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Looking at her again, she was a really cute girl, like a doll...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that face, still young, I sensed a <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="りん">dignified</STYLE> sharpness of some kind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> said, <STYLE ID="12">she</STYLE> must be a clever girl.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
And this girl...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "20" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "20" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
............!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What? This girl...<PG>
Most likely, this girl was <STYLE ID="14">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The moment I saw <STYLE ID="14">this girl's</STYLE> face, I felt every sweat gland in my body burst open.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="14">This girl</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
was exactly like <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, her face was completely different, and I knew she was someone else.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But how should I put it?<PG>
If <STYLE ID="14">this girl</STYLE> stood behind me and I was asked "Who's behind you?", I would answer "<STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>" without a doubt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In <STYLE ID="14">this girl</STYLE>, whose looks and air were completely different, I was sensing something that led back to <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sliding_wooden_door_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
I opened the window and stood in front of the full-length mirror.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
