{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And this blue eye, and this green eye.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if the blue eye was inherited from <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>, where did the green eye come from?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Kana</STYLE> has the same odd eyes as me, one blue and one green.<PG>
Since coming to Tokyo, I get told this a lot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That odd eyes, one blue and one green, are really beautiful.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm glad when people compliment me like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But a friend of mine once said something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That a Japanese person with odd eyes, one blue and one green, has probably never been seen before.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
