{MESON "500"}
I have the ability to foresee danger at this time of year.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's more, I don't have the condition <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> had, of needing a dark, narrow place.<PG>
When I was 10, at the same moment that power awoke in me, I was seized by an unbearable murderous intent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a nightmare: if I didn't kill <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>, I would die.<PG>
And then I had this year's first danger sense.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the Arata settlement, I―
{PAUSE ""}
will die.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's not just me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I saw many other people die too.<PG>
I looked at the photo on my phone again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
