{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="14">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE>―someone whose 'aura' is so like <STYLE ID="3">Mom's</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Surely... it couldn't be...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That <STYLE ID="14">this person</STYLE> has precognition too...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if, by some chance, she did, then the moment I came face to face with <STYLE ID="14">this girl</STYLE>, I might be seized by that murderous intent.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
