{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I'll ask <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> about it, casually.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll say something about her seems like <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>, and ask if there's anything special about her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No good... she probably won't answer that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because of the look in <STYLE ID="1">Auntie's</STYLE> eyes at the cafe earlier―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
