{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It also seemed as if she was keeping back the real reason <STYLE ID="14">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE> was coming to Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If you're hiding something, don't pry into what I'm hiding."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I think that was the gist of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If so, what on earth is she hiding...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why keep secrets now, after coming this far...?<PG>
............
{PAUSE ""}
I see... it adds up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the Arata settlement, precognition like <STYLE ID="3">Mom's</STYLE> had come to be called 'the witch's power' and shunned.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They made all the use of it they wanted while <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> was alive, and then the moment rumors started that it might be <STYLE ID="3">Mom's</STYLE> curse, this is how they treat it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's part of why I haven't told anyone about this power.<PG>
In other words, knowing that <STYLE ID="14">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE> has that power would put me on my guard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Let me sort out the situation a little.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="14">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE> may have precognition (the 'witch's power') like me and <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There are two reasons―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・She feels like <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> (my own impression)
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・<STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> is hiding something
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then the sight I saw just now, when I <STYLE ID="15" RUBY="のぞ">looked</STYLE> into the mirror.<PG>
I am going to die.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Cut deep across the back on April 8, or cut clean in two.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or else stabbed to death from behind by <STYLE ID="16">Haruka</STYLE>, turned green-eyed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There seem to be a few branching points, but either way, I don't survive.<PG>
Knowing that, I can act to avoid death, but with death dogging me this closely, there's no guarantee I'll live through it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This coming April 8, something is going to happen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something big, something the settlement's survival hangs on.<PG>
