{MESON "500"}
Still, there's one thing I can be optimistic about.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There are almost no cherry trees in Arata, and the Niimura main house's cherry is withering too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My precognition doesn't work in Arata anymore either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the same way, <STYLE ID="14">Natsumi Kogori's</STYLE> power will probably be sealed off too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thinking of it that way, as long as I'm in the Arata settlement, I shouldn't be seized by murderous intent either.<PG>
So what I can do now comes down to one of two things―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's whether or not to get <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> to tell me <STYLE ID="14">Natsumi Kogori's</STYLE> secret.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And that amounts to honestly telling <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> everything I've done.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The curse-killings I caused in the past, and what <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> and the others did.<PG>
Unless I tell her that, <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> probably won't answer my question.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Would <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> accept what I've done, and protect my family?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If she would, it would mean burdening <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> with the same sin as mine, though...<PG>
Well, what do I do...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Confess my sins to <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or keep my sins hidden to the end?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is a very important choice.
